<title>EGYPT: Egypt Arab African Bank H1 profit up.</title>
<headline>Egypt Arab African Bank H1 profit up.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt Arab African Bank/EAAB results for the first half of the 1997 calender year, the bank's financial year:</p>
<p>(All figures in thousands of Egyptian pounds)</p>
<p>				 30 June 97	30 June 96</p>
<p>    Total assets	    1,425,276	 1,229,193</p>
<p>    Total deposits	    783,458	   654,463</p>
<p>    Provisions		  144,466	   133,075</p>
<p>    Reserves		     50,158	    41,500</p>
<p>    Shareholders funds	150,470	   109,668</p>
<p>    Profit for the period    21,998	    15,957</p>
<p>($1 = 3.395 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
